# Flight trees are EVIDENCE, not source, and they are large: a single web arm
# carries ~2.1M chars of fetched pages plus a debug log that can reach 200MB.
# What must survive a flight is committed elsewhere and is small:
#   - the scored deliverable + judge output  -> drb/overall-derivation/flights-*
#   - the fetched evidence itself            -> the daemon corpus the run
#     ingests into (`dr-estate-dr-<run_id>`), which is what replay reads
# So the run trees stay local. A finding that rests on one cites its run id.
runs-acquisition-ab/
runs-web-composite/
runs-outline-ab/
